    <bpmn:process id="W_W3753" name="W3753. ECM Project Delivery, Commissioning &amp; Handover" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved ECM project (W3749); capex release
Frequency: Per project
Volume: ECM project portfolio
Owner: EEO / Facilities / PMO
Participants: EEO, Facilities (links to VS-20.3), PMO (links to VS-112), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Finance/Capex (links to VS-40), Store Ops (links to VS-07), DC Ops (links to VS-04), Contractors, Commissioning Agent
Source: workflow W3753 — ECM Project Delivery, Commissioning &amp; Handover</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3753_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3753_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3753_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3753_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3753_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3753_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3753_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3753_Start3" name="Approved ECM project (W3749); capex release">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3753_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3753_Task4" name="EEO/Facilities/PMO deliver the ECM project: design, procurement (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Facilities/PMO deliver the ECM project: design, procurement (links to VS-34), construction/installation, schedule/cost/quality management (links to VS-112), and coordination with store/DC operations to minimize disruption (links to VS-07/VS-04)
Responsible (R): EEO / Facilities / PMO / Contractor
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3753_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3753_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3753_Task5" name="EEO/Facilities/Commissioning Agent commission the ECM: functional performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Facilities/Commissioning Agent commission the ECM: functional performance testing, BMS/control verification, balancing, and confirmation that the system meets the design/energy-intent before handover
Responsible (R): EEO / Facilities / Commissioning Agent
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3753_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3753_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3753_Task6" name="EEO/Facilities/Store Ops hand over to operations: train facility/store staff on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Facilities/Store Ops hand over to operations: train facility/store staff on the new system/SOPs (links to VS-19.4), update the BMS and asset register (links to VS-35), transfer to maintenance (links to VS-20.3), and initiate M&amp;V (W3747)
Responsible (R): EEO / Facilities / Store Ops / HR
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3753_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3753_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3753_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3753_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-591 (ensure controlled execution — ECM Delivery, Performance Optimization &amp; Compliance Analytics (PA-120.3).) | - operational: commissioning; operational: phasing around store hours
Owner: EEO / Facilities / PMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
