    <bpmn:process id="W_W3754" name="W3754. Continuous Energy Performance Monitoring &amp; Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Metering data (W3741); M&amp;V cycle; performance drift
Frequency: Continuous + periodic
Volume: ~205 sites
Owner: EEO / Sustainability
Participants: EEO, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), BI (links to VS-28.1), Store Ops (links to VS-07), DC Ops (links to VS-04), IT/BMS (links to VS-27.2)
Source: workflow W3754 — Continuous Energy Performance Monitoring &amp; Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3754_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3754_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3754_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3754_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3754_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3754_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3754_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3754_Start3" name="Metering data (W3741); M&amp;V cycle; performance drift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3754_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3754_Task4" name="EEO/BI monitor energy performance continuously across ~205 sites: consumption…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/BI monitor energy performance continuously across ~205 sites: consumption vs baseline/target (W3740), EnPI dashboards (kWh/sqm, cost), anomaly/fault detection (BMS faults, consumption spikes), and outlier-site identification
Responsible (R): EEO / BI / Facilities
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3754_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3754_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3754_Task5" name="EEO/Facilities diagnose and correct performance issues: BMS re-tuning, setpoint…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Facilities diagnose and correct performance issues: BMS re-tuning, setpoint correction, equipment fault resolution, and re-commissioning where needed (links to W3750); drive sites back to target performance
Responsible (R): EEO / Facilities / BMS
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3754_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3754_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3754_Task6" name="EEO/Sustainability report performance to governance (links to W3737/VS-25.3)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Sustainability report performance to governance (links to W3737/VS-25.3), feed to ESG/GHG (links to VS-25), and drive the continuous-improvement cycle (W3760); validate ECM savings persistence (W3747)
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability / BI
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3754_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3754_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3754_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3754_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-591 (ensure controlled execution — ECM Delivery, Performance Optimization &amp; Compliance Analytics (PA-120.3).) | - operational: continuous monitoring; operational: fault-detection and correction
Owner: EEO / Sustainability</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
