    <bpmn:process id="W_W3755" name="W3755. DOE EICC/Energy Reporting &amp; Compliance Submission" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: RA 11285 reporting cycle; designation (W3738)
Frequency: Annual + periodic per DOE requirement
Volume: Per designated entity
Owner: EEO / Compliance
Participants: EEO, Compliance (links to VS-22), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Finance (links to VS-17), Records (links to VS-88), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72)
Source: workflow W3755 — DOE EICC/Energy Reporting &amp; Compliance Submission</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3755_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3755_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3755_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3755_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3755_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3755_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3755_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3755_Start3" name="RA 11285 reporting cycle; designation (W3738)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3755_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3755_Task4" name="EEO/Compliance/Sustainability prepare the annual energy-consumption and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Compliance/Sustainability prepare the annual energy-consumption and conservation report per RA 11285 IRR: consumption by source/fuel, intensity, ECM progress, savings achieved, and conservation-plan execution; consolidate entity data (links to W3758)
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability / Compliance
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3755_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3755_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3755_Task5" name="EEO/Compliance submit the report/certification to DOE via the prescribed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Compliance submit the report/certification to DOE via the prescribed framework (EICC/online portal), manage DOE review/query, and maintain the submission record; coordinate cross-entity (links to VS-72)
Responsible (R): EEO / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3755_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3755_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3755_Task6" name="EEO/Compliance/Records archive submissions to records (links to VS-88/W3744)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Compliance/Records archive submissions to records (links to VS-88/W3744), report compliance status to governance (links to W3737/VS-22) and audit (links to VS-21), and manage any DOE finding/corrective action
Responsible (R): EEO / Compliance / Records
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3755_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3755_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3755_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
