    <bpmn:process id="W_W3756" name="W3756. Energy Cost, Consumption &amp; GHG Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; governance review
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Program analytics
Owner: EEO / BI
Participants: EEO, BI (links to VS-28.1), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), ESG (links to VS-25.3), Treasury (links to VS-18)
Source: workflow W3756 — Energy Cost, Consumption &amp; GHG Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3756_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3756_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3756_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3756_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3756_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3756_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3756_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3756_Start3" name="Reporting cycle; governance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3756_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3756_Task4" name="EEO/BI maintain the energy analytics dashboard: consumption (kWh) and cost by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/BI maintain the energy analytics dashboard: consumption (kWh) and cost by site/entity/source, intensity (kWh/sqm, kWh/revenue), EnPI trends, ECM-savings realized, and energy-procurement cost (links to W3742)
Responsible (R): EEO / BI / Finance
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3756_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3756_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3756_Task5" name="EEO/Sustainability convert energy data to GHG impact (Scope 1 fuel, Scope 2…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Sustainability convert energy data to GHG impact (Scope 1 fuel, Scope 2 electricity per W192/W3466), report combined cost/consumption/GHG analytics, and align to ESG/GHG accounting (links to VS-25) and decarbonization targets
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability / BI
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3756_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3756_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
