    <bpmn:process id="W_W3760" name="W3760. EEC Program Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual program review; maturity assessment
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: Program maturity
Owner: EEO / Sustainability
Participants: EEO, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Audit (links to VS-21), BI (links to VS-28.1), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Governance (links to VS-36/VS-25.3)
Source: workflow W3760 — EEC Program Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3760_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3760_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3760_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3760_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3760_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3760_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3760_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3760_Start3" name="Annual program review; maturity assessment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3760_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3760_Task4" name="EEO/Sustainability assess program maturity against an energy-management…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Sustainability assess program maturity against an energy-management maturity model (compliant → systematic → integrated → best-in-class, ISO 50001-aligned), identify gaps, and set the maturity roadmap
Responsible (R): EEO / Audit / Sustainability
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3760_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3760_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3760_Task5" name="EEO drive continuous improvement: expand sub-metering/visibility, advance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO drive continuous improvement: expand sub-metering/visibility, advance analytics (W3756), deepen ECM pipeline, mature controls, integrate efficiency-renewable-decarbonization (W3752), and embed energy in capital/store-remodel decisions (links to VS-109/VS-112)
Responsible (R): EEO / Facilities / Sustainability
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3760_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3760_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3760_Task6" name="EEO report program maturity, energy/cost/GHG performance vs targets, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO report program maturity, energy/cost/GHG performance vs targets, and residual energy risk to governance (links to W3737/VS-25.3), the executive risk/sustainability committee (links to VS-21.2), and the board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability
Accountable (A): COO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3760_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3760_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3760_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3760_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-591 (ensure controlled execution — ECM Delivery, Performance Optimization &amp; Compliance Analytics (PA-120.3).) | - operational: maturity roadmap; operational: continuous-improvement and ECM pipeline
Owner: EEO / Sustainability</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
